@startuml
[*] --> InputPreferences

InputPreferences --> AnalyzePreferencesHistory : Submit preferences
AnalyzePreferencesHistory --> GenerateRecommendations : Process data
GenerateRecommendations --> ViewRecommendations : Display recommendations

ViewRecommendations --> [*] : Exit
ViewRecommendations --> InputPreferences : Refine preferences or continue
ViewRecommendations --> ShareRecommendations : Share recommendations

ShareRecommendations --> ViewRecommendations : Continue
ShareRecommendations --> [*] : Exit

@enduml
